            aOrbiterB = ((aOrbiterB ^ aOrbiterA) ^ 0x5C7D329DFC686AA7ULL) ^ aTwistOrbiterUpdateSaltE[(((31U - aIndex) + 14U)) & S_SALT1];
            aOrbiterB = RotL64((aOrbiterB * 0xC16314C8BF828925ULL), 47U);
